---
import { notoooIdentity, type NotoooBook } from '../../data/notooo';

interface Props { book: NotoooBook; compact?: boolean; }

const { book, compact = false } = Astro.props;
const number = String(book.number).padStart(3, '0');
---

<article
  class:list={['sheet', { compact }]}
  data-notooo-sheet
  aria-label={`${book.title} one-page visual synthesis`}
  style={`--notooo-color:${notoooIdentity.color};--notooo-color-light:${notoooIdentity.colorLight};`}
>
  <header class="sheet-header"><span>NOTOOO {number} · {book.category.toUpperCase()}</span><h2>{book.title}</h2><p>{book.author} · {book.publicationYear}</p></header>
  <section class="big"><b>BIG IDEA</b><p>{book.sheet.bigIdea}</p><strong>{book.sheet.systemsLine}</strong></section>
  <div class="two"><section><b>WHO ARE YOU BECOMING?</b><p>Instead of only asking “What do I want?”, ask “Who do I want to become?”</p><strong>{book.sheet.identity}</strong></section><section><b>GOAL vs SYSTEM</b><p>Goals choose the direction. Systems move you there.</p><strong>Destination ← Goal<br/>Path ← System</strong></section></div>
  <section class="loop"><b>HOW A HABIT FORMS</b><strong>{book.sheet.habitLoop.join(' → ')} ↻</strong><p>Cue: notice · Craving: want · Response: act · Reward: value</p></section>
  <section><b>THE FOUR LAWS</b><div class="laws">{book.sheet.laws.map((law, index)=><div><em>{index + 1}</em><strong>{law.title}</strong><p>{law.note}</p></div>)}</div><small>BREAK A BAD HABIT → Invisible · Unattractive · Difficult · Unsatisfying</small></section>
  <div class="two"><section><b>DESIGN THE ROOM</b><p>{book.sheet.environment}</p><strong>🍎 visible · 🍪 hidden</strong></section><section><b>TWO-MINUTE RULE</b><p>{book.sheet.startSmall}</p><strong>2 minutes → start → continue</strong></section></div>
  <div class="two"><section><b>PROGRESS NEEDS TIME</b><p>Small results can be invisible first.</p><svg viewBox="0 0 200 80" role="img" aria-label="An upward curve showing delayed visible results"><path d="M8 68 C70 68,110 66,130 45 S164 18,192 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M8 70H196" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></section><section><b>RETURN QUICKLY</b><p>{book.sheet.consistency}</p><strong>✓ ✓ ✓ ✓ ✕ ✓ ✓ ✓</strong></section></div>
  <section class="example"><b>WANT TO BECOME A READER?</b><p>I am a reader. ↓ Leave a book visible. ↓ Read one page. ↓ Mark the day complete. ↓ Repeat tomorrow.</p></section>
  <section class="take"><b>KHIZOOO TAKE</b><p>{book.sheet.takeaway}</p></section>
  <footer class="sheet-footer"><b>REMEMBER →</b><strong>{book.sheet.remember}</strong><div class="artifact-brand"><span>NOTOOO · KHIZOOOLOGY</span><span>One Book. One Page.</span></div></footer>
</article>

<style>
  .sheet { --ink: #27303a; --accent: var(--notooo-color); box-sizing: border-box; width: min(100%, 1120px); aspect-ratio: 210 / 297; margin: auto; padding: clamp(1.1rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(.4rem, 1.1vw, .85rem); background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffdf5, var(--notooo-color-light)); color: var(--ink); border: 2px solid var(--accent); border-radius: .3rem; box-shadow: 0 18px 54px #0002; font: clamp(.64rem, 1.25vw, 1rem)/1.4 Mulish, sans-serif; }
  .sheet > * { flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .sheet-header { border-bottom: 4px solid var(--accent); padding-bottom: .45rem; }
  .sheet-header span, .sheet b { font: 900 .75em Poppins, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .09em; }
  .sheet h2 { margin: 0; font: 900 clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 3.4rem)/1 Poppins, sans-serif; }
  .sheet p { margin: .25rem 0; }
  .sheet section { border: 1.5px solid currentColor; border-radius: .45rem; padding: .6rem; background: #fffdf8d9; }
  .sheet strong { display: block; font: 800 .9em Poppins, sans-serif; }
  .big { text-align: center; border: 2px solid var(--accent) !important; background: #fffdf8 !important; }
  .big p { font: 800 .95em/1.25 Poppins, sans-serif; }
  .big strong { font-size: .82em; line-height: 1.2; }
  .two { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .55rem; }
  .loop { text-align: center; }
  .loop > strong { font-size: 1.1em; color: var(--accent); }
  .laws { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: .4rem; margin: .35rem 0; }
  .laws div { padding: .35rem; border: 1px dashed var(--accent); }
  .laws em { font-style: normal; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; padding: .05rem .25rem; font-weight: 900; }
  .laws p { font-size: .85em; }
  .sheet svg { width: 100%; height: 54px; color: var(--accent); }
  .take { background: var(--notooo-color-light) !important; border-color: var(--accent) !important; transform: rotate(-.5deg); }
  .example { border-style: dashed !important; }
  .sheet-footer { display: grid; gap: .25rem; margin-top: auto; padding: .65rem 0 0; border-top: 4px solid var(--accent); }
  .sheet-footer > strong { font-size: 1.1em; }
  .artifact-brand { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: .75rem; color: var(--accent); font: 900 .7em Poppins, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .07em; }
  .compact { font-size: 35%; padding: 5%; box-shadow: none; border-width: 1px; }
  .compact .sheet { pointer-events: none; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .sheet { font-size: clamp(.5rem, 2.2vw, .72rem); padding: .8rem; gap: .3rem; } .two { gap: .3rem; } .laws { gap: .2rem; } .sheet section { padding: .35rem; } .artifact-brand { gap: .25rem; } }
  @media print { .sheet { width: 210mm !important; height: 297mm !important; aspect-ratio: auto; margin: 0; padding: 10mm; border: 0; border-radius: 0; box-shadow: none; print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; } }
</style>
